1. The problem that I was analyzing was with the Video Games Datasheet, and how tens of thousnands of videogames compare to each other, either by critic score, 
or regional/global sales of their games.

2. The insights I found when working on this project is that there is a lot more to creating a system with data than meets the eye. There are many variables you have to
consider from how to create the database, to maintaining it, deleting it, archiving it, and presenting it in an appealing visual manner to the end-user, or client.

3. The directory structure of the project is complete with the munge folder, a folder for the reports, and a folder for the source code.
